<title>PHILIPPINES: EEI to increase capital stock.</title>
<headline>EEI to increase capital stock.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction concern EEI Corp said on Thursday it will increase its common capital capital stock to two billion pesos from 875 million pesos.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange, the firm said the new structure will consist of two billion common shares at a par value of one peso each.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
